Censorguard contains a migrated eBPF data-plane source derived from the local ohmyguard
repository, branch feat/pidtree-domain, commit fa1f28546abecd01fe07c0e14bad3aad1d077070.

The migration preserves the original `bpf/enforce.bpf.c` behavior during parity phases. New Rust
Project-owned userspace code and the C libbpf shim are maintained in this repository under MulanPSL-2.0.
